# Build-context exclusions for the frontend image (Phase 11G / M-11).
#
# The compose `frontend` service builds with `context: ./frontend`, so the
# repository-root `.dockerignore` does NOT apply here. Without this file the
# context includes node_modules/.next (hundreds of MB) and the build stalls.
# Source, package.json and package-lock.json are all that the image needs.

node_modules/
.next/
out/
coverage/
.vitest/
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
